<!-- ============================== THE PHYSICS ============================= -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head tight">
    <p class="kicker">The Measured Account</p>
    <h2 id="t-what-entropy-actually-is">What Entropy Actually Is</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">Not disorder, not decay, not the universe running down into a mess. Entropy is a
    count. Everything strange about it follows from the fact that there are vastly more ways to be
    ordinary than to be particular.</p>
  </div>

