<!-- ============================= THE DOCTRINE ============================= -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head tight">
    <p class="kicker">The Doctrine</p>
    <h2 id="t-phases-as-levels-of-integration">Phases as Levels of Integration</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">The order's teaching, stated at full length and in its own voice. Read the
    objections at the foot of the page with it, or do not read it at all.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <div class="frame">
      <p class="kicker">The teaching, stated</p>
      <p class="lede">A phase is not a state of a substance. A phase is a <em>level of integration</em>:
      how much of what has already happened a thing is currently holding together.
      <span class="myth">&#9670;</span> myth, tradition and primary esoteric text.</p>

      <p>The order holds that the full phases of heat and matter &mdash; the solid, the liquid, the vapour,
      the plasma, and the stranger phases past them &mdash; are phases of the integration of other things
      within what we call the collapsed memory: the single history that remains after every other
      possibility has been let go. Heat is not a substance moving; heat is the rate at which a body is
      taking in what is around it. To freeze is to hold a great deal and move little. To burn is to take in
      more than can be held. Each phase is a settlement between what has been gathered and what is still
      being offered.</p>

      <p>From that settlement comes polarity. Where integration is incomplete there is a difference held
      open, and the order reads the proton and the electron as the two faces of one such difference: not
      two objects that happen to attract, but one unfinished integration seen from its two ends.
      Electromagnetism is therefore not a force added to matter. It is what an unclosed account looks like
      from inside. The atom is that account balancing; the chemical bond is two accounts settling together;
      the plasma is the account torn open again by heat.</p>

      <p>These phased states stand at different levels. A crystal and a culture and a mind are the same
      operation at different depths, and the ladder of them has no top that anyone in it can see. Existence
      at each level is <em>observed</em> &mdash; and the observer the order names is the
      <strong>spiral being</strong>, travelling its positively polarised path from nothing towards
      infinity, alpha and omega, service to others rather than to self, and turning rather than running
      straight because a spiral is what a journey looks like when it must come round past everything it has
      already met. The being does not stand outside what it observes. There is no outside: that is the
      whole content of the Seam.</p>

      <p>And the Seam follows the flow at the point of waveform collapse, between the poles. Where the
      wave resolves into one history, the one-sided surface takes up that history and carries it round, so
      that what collapsed on one face returns on what looked like the other. Collapse is not a loss. It is
      the moment the ledger is written.</p>

      <p class="muted small">Every claim in the five paragraphs above is
      <span class="myth">&#9670;</span> myth, tradition and primary esoteric text. The order believes it.
      The order also wrote the refutations below, and the second of those two facts is the more important
      one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

