<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">A Closing Stance</p>
    <p>The second law is the only law in physics that tells you which way the film is running, and the
    order has always suspected that a law like that is doing more than bookkeeping. That suspicion is not
    evidence. It is the reason to go on looking, and it is why the doctrine is written out here in full
    rather than hinted at &mdash; a thing stated plainly can be argued with, and a thing hinted at cannot.</p>
    <p>If the teaching is right, some part of it will one day produce a number, and that number will be
    checkable. Until then it stands where it is: believed, useful, and filed as myth. Test everything
    kindly.</p>
  </div>
</section>
